        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"BlueHairedMeerkat\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/48/1967_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> BlueHairedMeerkat:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>imprimis5 wrote:</b><br><blockquote>&nbsp;BlueHairedMeerkat wrote:<br><blockquote>Captain Cosmic will have a 40-card deck, plus a character card. Said card will feature a picture of the Captain, a power, and the Sentinel Comics logo with a hit point total below, and will have a picture of him defeated on the back, with three incapacitated powers. The deck itself will be a mixture of one-shot, ongoing and equipment cards, some of which will be limited and some of which will be duplicates. All will have art and flavour text. His playstyle will consist largely of using powers and drawing and playing cards, with a focus on some combination of damage, healing, card draw, deck control, deck searching, damage reduction, damage redirection, damage boosting, ongoing destruction, environment destruction, and the ability to play more cards and use more powers.&nbsp;\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nYou realise, of course, that they're going to completely switch him up now just to spite you.\n</blockquote></div>\nI would hope they'd have more integrity than that.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Fickle and vindictive can be fun.</p>",
